### **Acceptance criteria:**

Create stories with a button which opens the following toasts:

* neutral toast with icon , title and action - vertical 
* success toast with icon , title , description and action - vertical
* warning toast with title  , description and two actions - horizontal
* error toast with icon , title and description - horizontal

### **Technical Details:** 

_**molecule/Toaster**_

```
interface ToasterProps {
    id: string;
    title: string;
    subline?: string;
    variant: 'neutral' | 'success' | 'warning' | 'error';
    orientation: 'vertical' | 'horizontal';
    showIcon?: boolean;
    position? : 'top left' | 'top right' | 'bottom left' | 'bottom right' 
    ctas:cta?: {
      text: string;
      variant: ButtonVariant;
      href: string;
    }[];
    autoDismiss?: boolean;
    duration?: number;
}
```

* create store that will control state of toasters queue using `createGlobalState`, similar to `lightboxStore` 
* actions of the store

    * `ADD_TOAST`
    * `REMOVE_TOAST`
    * `UPDATE_TOAST`
    * `DISMISS_TOAST`
    * `SET_QUEUE_LIMIT`

* use `LuiIcon` , `LuiText`, `LuiButton`
